/*--------------------------------*- Choupo -*--------------------------------*\
  species/H2Succ.dat -- ONE model species, ONE typed file.

  The NEUTRAL, undissociated aqueous succinic acid: the speciation MASTER of the succinate family, from which
  the ions are formed by the records in chemistry/ (the tartrate pattern, species/H2Tart.dat).
  No `aqueousThermo { hfAq }` here, as for H2Tart: the neutral datum belongs to the solution-pair
  record, not to a species that would start pricing the neutral master on the aqueous energy
  rung.
\*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
recordType modelSpecies;
schemaVersion 1;

name    H2Succ;
formula     "H2C4H4O4";
charge  0;
MW { value 118.088; unit g/mol;}
